ed to the Lawsuits, as part of the consideration for Releasors’"
  },
  {
    "id": "c002",
    "name": "Representation of No Assignment of Claims",
    "text": "Releasors further represent and warrant that they have not assigned to any othec person or party all or any portion of the claim whatsoever that ENTAIRE GLOBAL COMPANIES, INC,, ENTAIRE GLOBAL FINANCIAL, INC., JONATHAN D. ROSEN AND WILLIAM R. MUIRHEAD may have or claim to have against Releasees, and that no other person or party is subrogated to any of Releasors’ rights in this matter."
  },
  {
    "id": "c003",
    "name": "1. Capacity of Parties",
    "text": "1. That Parties are each petsons over 18 yeers of age or corporate entities registered to do business in the State of Georgia and are each fully competent to enter into this agreement, and that each is operating under no present disability or limitation which would affect their capacity to enter into this agreement, and that each is sui juris"
  },
  {
    "id": "c004",
    "name": "2. Reliance on Own Judgment",
    "text": "2. That Parties rely wholly on their own jadgment, and that of their attorneys, in entering into this Release, and that the decision to enter into this Release is made without reliance upon any statement or representation by Releasees, Releasors, or their respective representatives, agents or attomeys, regarding the merits, legal liability or value of this claim or any matters relating thereto."
  },
  {
    "id": "c005",
    "name": "3. Voluntary Execution",
    "text": "3. That Parties each enter into this Release voluntarily."
  },
  {
    "id": "c006",
    "name": "Paragraph 4 — Entire Agreement / Merger",
    "text": "4, ‘That no promise or inducement or agreement not herein expressed has been made by the Parties and that this Release contains the entire agreement between the Parties, and that the terms of this reement ae conzartunl an not 8 mere rsa"
  },
  {
    "id": "c007",
    "name": "5. No Assignment or Subrogation",
    "text": "5. Releasors further represent and werrent that Releasors have not assigned to any other person or party all or any portion of the claim whatsoever that Releasors may have or claim to have against Releases and that no other person or party is subrogated to any of Releasors’ rights in this matter."
  },
  {
    "id": "c008",
    "name": "Reliance on Releasors' Representations",
    "text": "Reteasors onderstund and acknowledge that Releases, in providing the consideration herein described, duly rely upon the truth, aocuracy and validity of all promises, representations and warranties of the Releasors contained herein."
