  {
    "id": "c010",
    "name": "Scope of Release of All Actions",
    "text": "IT IS UNDERSTOOD AND AGREED that this is a Release of any and all actions, causes of actions, rights of action, claims and demands of whatsoever kind and nature between ‘the Parties arising from and for, upon or by reason of any damage, loss or injury, known or unknown, which may be traced either directly or indirectly to the Lawsuits or any incident or occurrence underlying or giving rise to the Lawsuits, even to the extent of death, or as may appear at any time in the future, no matter how remotely any such potential claim may be related fo the Lawsuits or any incident or occurrence underlying or giving rise to the Lawsuits."
